  "scope": "只取四川中路沿街南端山花窗组和石门罩。墙高、门洞进深、砖缝和遮挡处按影像比例估算。",
  "street_numbers": "市房管局第二批2A055为185号；项目历史转录及OSM具名足印为175号。2013年街道牌标南175、北215，石门罩右侧小牌为181。三者分别保留。",
  "age_and_designer": "档案543记1903年，1908年出版照片与现存四层东立面辨认一致。工作名录转录另有1937年和公和洋行；无法从现有照片将其认作本立面的初建时期。百科称平野勇造，工程原图或设计签名尚缺。",
  "historic_captions": [
    "Twentieth Century Impressions of Hongkong, Shanghai, and Other Treaty Ports of China (1908), plate caption “Mitsui Bussan Kaisha Premises in Szechuen Road”; book plate reproduced by Internet Archive/PICRYL. The reproduction does not identify an individual photographer.",
    "Virtual Shanghai / IrAsia. Collection record cites Hirofumi Takatsuna and Chen Zuen, Riben qiaomin zai Shanghai (1870–1945), 2000, and dates the photograph 1915–1935. The listed date field is 1915; no individual photographer is given."
